<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="72166" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/ARTD/418/72166.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2025" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025.xml">2025</calendarYear><term id="120251" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring.xml">Spring 2025</term><subject id="ARTD" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/ARTD.xml">Art--Design</subject><course id="418" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/ARTD/418.xml">Advanced Interaction Design</course></parents><sectionNumber>4  </sectionNumber><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>This advanced studio course explores the cutting edge of digital interaction with a focus on Motion Design. Students will investigate how dynamic motion can enhance user experiences across mobile interfaces and interactive environments. Through hands-on projects, they will prototype responsive systems that integrate animation, transitions, and environmental interactions, culminating in speculative designs that envision the future of motion in digital interaction.</sectionText><partOfTerm>1</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>Closed</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2025-01-21Z</startDate><endDate>2025-05-07Z</endDate><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="ST ">Studio</type><start>09:30 AM</start><end>12:10 PM</end><daysOfTheWeek>TR     </daysOfTheWeek><roomNumber>216</roomNumber><buildingName>Art and Design Building</buildingName><instructors><instructor lastName="Pridemore" firstName="J">Pridemore, J</instructor><instructor lastName="Xiao" firstName="Y">Xiao, Y</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>